WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.296
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

3
01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

4
01:35.260 --> 01:38.940
=Episode 30=

5
01:54.300 --> 01:56.420
Your Highness, Attendant Liu from the palace is here.

6
01:57.380 --> 01:57.900
Liu Wenji?

7
01:58.940 --> 01:59.300
Show him in.

8
01:59.700 --> 02:00.300
Show him in.

9
02:00.300 --> 02:00.660
Yes.

10
02:05.260 --> 02:05.820
Sir.

11
02:06.860 --> 02:07.140
Please.

12
02:08.060 --> 02:09.020
Bring out the finest tea.

13
02:09.220 --> 02:09.580
Yes.

14
02:10.940 --> 02:11.260
Please.

15
02:21.100 --> 02:22.340
Sir, you must be swamped with affairs.

16
02:23.220 --> 02:24.620
Do you have any news

17
02:25.460 --> 02:26.420
about my father?

18
02:31.740 --> 02:32.100
Your Highness.

19
02:33.260 --> 02:34.580
The Yu case has been under review for a long time.

20
02:35.100 --> 02:35.980
It implicates many.

21
02:37.060 --> 02:38.380
It's really hard to handle.

22
02:39.020 --> 02:41.260
Besides, my words carry little weight.

23
02:41.660 --> 02:44.340
I'm lucky to catch a scrap of it before His Majesty.

24
02:45.140 --> 02:46.620
How would I dare guess at His Majesty's mind?

25
02:47.780 --> 02:48.860
A scrap from you

26
02:48.860 --> 02:50.420
is a lifeline for my whole family.

27
02:51.260 --> 02:52.180
Please, for the sake

28
02:52.780 --> 02:53.820
of the Prince of Jin,

29
02:54.460 --> 02:55.380
give me a straight answer.

30
02:59.700 --> 03:00.220
Confiscation?

31
03:04.740 --> 03:05.100
Hurry!

32
03:05.820 --> 03:07.140
Bring my rosewood box with mother-of-pearl inlay.

33
03:07.500 --> 03:07.980
Yes.

34
03:24.780 --> 03:26.020
A small token from me.

35
03:28.060 --> 03:28.860
Please, sir,

36
03:30.260 --> 03:30.900
tell me what I should do.

37
03:41.740 --> 03:42.220
Your Highness.

38
03:43.260 --> 03:45.740
Some rumors don't arise

39
03:48.020 --> 03:48.980
out of thin air.

40
03:52.980 --> 03:53.780
Please put in a good word

41
03:54.100 --> 03:56.060
for the Liang family before His Majesty, sir.

42
03:57.140 --> 03:58.780
It's not about putting in a good word.

43
04:00.500 --> 04:02.460
Minister Liang is caught up in the Yu faction case.

44
04:02.860 --> 04:04.940
Confiscation is the least of what could happen.

45
04:06.020 --> 04:07.020
We must await His Majesty's decision.

46
04:20.420 --> 04:20.900
Your Highness.

47
04:21.940 --> 04:22.620
I am

48
04:23.140 --> 04:25.940
only taking this risk to warn you

49
04:26.740 --> 04:29.140
out of respect for your filial devotion.

50
04:30.020 --> 04:31.620
After all, he's your father.

51
04:32.540 --> 04:33.180
You

52
04:36.460 --> 04:37.900
should prepare yourself.

53
05:00.020 --> 05:00.900
(Blessings in Harmony with Time)

54
05:00.900 --> 05:01.420
Your Highness.

55
05:02.580 --> 05:03.100
Your Highness!

56
05:04.420 --> 05:06.500
For the sake of our marriage,

57
05:06.980 --> 05:07.540
please save me.

58
05:08.460 --> 05:09.220
Your Highness!

59
05:10.140 --> 05:10.860
Your Highness.

60
05:11.820 --> 05:14.140
For the sake of our marriage,

61
05:14.820 --> 05:15.460
please save me.

62
05:16.180 --> 05:17.060
Your Highness.

63
05:18.140 --> 05:20.340
Your Highness, say something.

64
05:22.100 --> 05:22.540
Your Highness.

65
05:23.700 --> 05:24.020
Your...

66
05:29.940 --> 05:30.900
Your Highness.

67
05:31.580 --> 05:32.500
Say something.

68
05:34.540 --> 05:35.300
Your Highness!

69
05:37.060 --> 05:38.340
Say something, Your Highness.

70
05:38.620 --> 05:39.460
Your Highness.

71
05:47.540 --> 05:47.900
(Your Highness,)

72
05:49.020 --> 05:49.940
(the Yu faction's treason)

73
05:50.580 --> 05:52.060
(is a crime beyond forgiveness.)

74
05:52.060 --> 05:52.860
Your Highness.

75
05:53.580 --> 05:54.580
(These days,)

76
05:55.260 --> 05:56.860
(no one involved in this case)

77
05:57.820 --> 05:59.020
(has met a good end.)

78
06:00.700 --> 06:02.260
(I'm sure I don't need to spell it out.)

79
06:08.420 --> 06:15.300
(Blessings in Harmony with Time)

80
06:30.540 --> 06:32.700
I never cared for your affection.

81
06:35.460 --> 06:36.940
(Blessings in Harmony with Time) I never thought much

82
06:38.260 --> 06:40.380
of this residence or you!

83
06:42.780 --> 06:44.060
I

84
06:45.300 --> 06:46.540
was born noble

85
06:47.940 --> 06:48.900
and lived with dignity.

86
06:50.260 --> 06:52.580
Yet I was married off here, only to be humiliated by you!

87
06:54.340 --> 06:55.780
You wretch.

88
06:57.620 --> 06:59.060
You wretch!

89
07:08.940 --> 07:12.700
(Blessings in Harmony with Time)

90
08:19.260 --> 08:21.220
I waited all these years for you to come.

91
08:23.500 --> 08:25.900
But I won't even get to hear

92
08:27.620 --> 08:28.700
you call me Mother

93
08:31.100 --> 08:32.260
before

94
08:33.740 --> 08:34.820
we part.

95
08:57.020 --> 08:58.980
Rather than be deposed, divorced,

96
09:00.060 --> 09:01.700
and trampled into the dirt,

97
09:03.660 --> 09:04.500
I might as well

98
09:04.500 --> 09:06.700
choose a dignified end

99
09:09.860 --> 09:12.020
while you still call me Your Highness.

100
09:35.820 --> 09:40.500
(The bearer of this is my trusted man. Follow Yang Si's orders in all matters.)

101
09:46.340 --> 09:47.420
(This is the Crown Prince's token.)

102
09:48.460 --> 09:48.940
(Lately,)

103
09:49.860 --> 09:50.860
(has there been an envoy)

104
09:50.860 --> 09:52.220
(probing into your dealings with the Crown Prince?)

105
09:52.940 --> 09:53.860
(His name is Yan Shang.)

106
09:54.900 --> 09:55.580
(Military Commander, rest assured.)

107
09:56.060 --> 09:56.980
(He's one of the Crown Prince's men too.)

108
10:02.900 --> 10:04.020
Did you see clearly?

109
10:04.740 --> 10:06.780
This is the Crown Prince's handwriting and seal.

110
10:07.740 --> 10:08.900
I'm the Crown Prince's real messenger.

111
10:10.340 --> 10:10.740
But...

112
10:11.820 --> 10:13.060
But Yan Shang has already...

113
10:18.340 --> 10:19.140
How much does he know?

114
10:24.260 --> 10:25.140
He knows everything?

115
10:29.580 --> 10:30.260
And the records?

116
10:31.780 --> 10:32.220
He...

117
10:34.780 --> 10:35.540
has seen them all.

118
11:17.500 --> 11:17.900
What's wrong?

119
11:20.420 --> 11:21.700
Hoofbeats are approaching.

120
11:22.940 --> 11:23.700
Horses moving that fast

121
11:24.460 --> 11:25.540
aren't privately owned.

122
11:32.820 --> 11:33.420
Take another road!

123
11:33.660 --> 11:34.100
Turn left.

124
11:35.700 --> 11:36.220
Left!

125
11:37.020 --> 11:37.460
What?

126
11:44.140 --> 11:44.820
This coachman is up to something!

127
11:45.180 --> 11:45.620
Hold on tight!

128
13:32.140 --> 13:33.860
So you're the Crown Prince's backup plan.

129
13:38.740 --> 13:39.140
Yan Shang.

130
13:39.500 --> 13:39.900
Let's go.

131
13:59.220 --> 13:59.700
Yan Shang.

132
14:01.140 --> 14:01.700
Your Highness.

133
14:09.940 --> 14:10.460
Yan Shang.

134
14:11.860 --> 14:12.340
Yan Shang.

135
14:13.020 --> 14:13.580
Look at me

136
14:15.300 --> 14:16.060
Your Highness.

137
14:18.580 --> 14:19.940
A normal arrow wound wouldn't be like this.

138
14:20.460 --> 14:21.300
Something's wrong with this arrow.

139
14:22.180 --> 14:22.820
Bear with it.

140
14:36.860 --> 14:37.340
Yan Shang.

141
14:39.060 --> 14:39.500
Yan Shang.

142
14:40.140 --> 14:40.580
Yan Shang.

143
14:43.140 --> 14:43.700
Your Highness.

144
14:43.700 --> 14:44.180
What kind of poison

145
14:44.740 --> 14:45.780
do you think this is?

146
14:48.260 --> 14:48.860
I

147
14:51.060 --> 14:52.740
don't know.

148
14:53.180 --> 14:53.980
This is Lingnan.

149
14:54.420 --> 14:55.900
How can there be anything you don't know?

150
14:58.580 --> 14:59.260
Your Highness,

151
15:00.660 --> 15:02.140
I'm a scholar,

152
15:03.700 --> 15:05.300
not a hunter.

153
15:21.940 --> 15:22.500
Bite it.

154
15:49.380 --> 15:49.820
Yan Shang.

155
15:50.300 --> 15:50.740
Yan Shang.

156
16:03.260 --> 16:03.780
Yan Shang.

157
16:06.780 --> 16:07.260
Yan Shang.

158
16:09.580 --> 16:10.060
Yan Shang.

159
16:10.700 --> 16:11.300
Wake up.

160
16:20.500 --> 16:21.500
I'm

161
16:22.620 --> 16:23.780
useless.

162
16:24.900 --> 16:25.620
I actually

163
16:27.060 --> 16:28.380
passed out from the pain.

164
16:28.820 --> 16:29.820
You've been poisoned.

165
16:35.300 --> 16:36.020
Your Highness.

166
16:37.420 --> 16:37.860
I

167
16:39.860 --> 16:41.180
can't walk.

168
16:46.740 --> 16:47.900
Listen to me.

169
16:49.660 --> 16:50.060
You...

170
16:50.780 --> 16:51.700
You get out of here.

171
16:53.780 --> 16:55.140
Come back for me

172
16:56.780 --> 16:57.660
once

173
16:59.580 --> 17:00.380
you're safe.

174
17:00.380 --> 17:01.060
Stop talking nonsense.

175
17:02.460 --> 17:02.780
Let's go.

176
17:02.780 --> 17:05.780
♪Be the ferry where you wait for the sun♪

177
17:07.980 --> 17:13.260
♪Be the blue silk that catches your tears♪

178
17:15.260 --> 17:15.980
Wanyao.

179
17:17.380 --> 17:18.580
It's raining.

180
17:21.060 --> 17:21.860
It's just dew.

181
17:24.260 --> 17:25.060
If it rains,

182
17:25.500 --> 17:26.140
we're in trouble.

183
17:27.300 --> 17:27.900
It's

184
17:29.460 --> 17:30.860
much colder tonight than the night

185
17:31.620 --> 17:32.500
you carried me.

186
17:36.940 --> 17:37.460
I

187
17:38.660 --> 17:39.460
am not cold.

188
17:41.180 --> 17:41.740
And

189
17:42.940 --> 17:44.140
I'm not in pain.

190
17:45.100 --> 17:45.780
You fool.

191
17:47.140 --> 17:48.420
I know what it feels like to bleed.

192
17:48.420 --> 17:51.780
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

193
17:51.860 --> 17:56.860
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

194
17:57.220 --> 17:57.900
Yan Shang.

195
17:59.220 --> 17:59.940
What mountain

196
18:02.540 --> 18:03.620
is this?

197
18:06.060 --> 18:07.100
And what kind of trees

198
18:09.380 --> 18:10.420
are these?

199
18:11.580 --> 18:15.020
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

200
18:15.140 --> 18:18.260
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

201
18:18.260 --> 18:18.980
Answer me.

202
18:21.580 --> 18:22.700
I won't let you fall asleep.

203
18:25.900 --> 18:26.420
Yan Shang.

204
18:26.420 --> 18:27.820
♪- May time be free of fear; - Boats rock♪

205
18:27.820 --> 18:29.820
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn - May time be free of pain♪

206
18:29.820 --> 18:30.260
Yan Shang.

207
18:30.500 --> 18:33.060
♪You're the only one I need♪

208
18:33.340 --> 18:33.940
Yan Shang.

209
18:36.700 --> 18:37.780
So many

210
18:39.300 --> 18:40.620
pine trees.

211
18:40.620 --> 18:42.620
♪- Be my one and only in this world; - Be my one and only in this life♪

212
18:42.620 --> 18:43.500
Just like

213
18:44.580 --> 18:46.700
the estate you gave me.

214
18:49.460 --> 18:50.020
When

215
18:51.460 --> 18:53.660
are we going back?

216
18:55.900 --> 18:57.020
I'll get you back. I promise.

217
19:10.500 --> 19:11.260
A few of you, search over there!

218
19:11.940 --> 19:13.140
Search every inch!

219
19:15.860 --> 19:16.340
Check over there!

220
19:18.060 --> 19:18.780
Something over here!

221
19:20.500 --> 19:20.820
Sir!

222
19:26.420 --> 19:26.780
Sir.

223
19:28.180 --> 19:29.100
We found bloodstains over here.

224
19:29.420 --> 19:29.780
Search the mountain.

225
19:30.940 --> 19:31.260
Yes!

226
19:32.420 --> 19:32.900
Search the mountain!

227
19:33.220 --> 19:33.940
Yes!

228
19:38.700 --> 19:39.580
Search carefully!

229
19:40.540 --> 19:40.860
Got it!

230
19:41.820 --> 19:42.900
A few of you, come check over here!

231
19:58.460 --> 19:59.140
Check over there!

232
20:00.140 --> 20:00.420
Move!

233
20:26.300 --> 20:27.500
How did you end up like this?

234
20:28.940 --> 20:30.740
Is this his blood or yours?

235
20:31.500 --> 20:32.100
Yu Niang is dead.

236
20:33.900 --> 20:34.420
I killed her.

237
20:35.060 --> 20:35.620
You?

238
20:38.020 --> 20:38.380
Wait,

239
20:38.940 --> 20:39.900
why was she here?

240
20:40.260 --> 20:41.540
Because my dear brother,

241
20:42.660 --> 20:43.340
the Crown Prince,

242
20:44.100 --> 20:44.980
doesn't trust you.

243
20:52.780 --> 20:54.140
Wanyao, how could you kill someone?

244
20:54.660 --> 20:55.220
Surprised?

245
20:55.780 --> 20:56.860
It's not my first time.

246
20:58.700 --> 20:59.220
Yang Si,

247
21:00.820 --> 21:01.860
you really don't know me.

248
21:03.580 --> 21:04.460
She was going to kill Yan Shang.

249
21:05.140 --> 21:06.060
I had no choice.

250
21:06.900 --> 21:07.620
If it had been me,

251
21:09.140 --> 21:09.780
would you have killed me too?

252
21:12.380 --> 21:12.700
Yes.

253
21:23.580 --> 21:23.980
Yan Shang.

254
21:35.780 --> 21:36.460
You're finally awake.

255
21:37.420 --> 21:39.340
You were as cold as ice just now.

256
22:04.900 --> 22:05.900
I really am

257
22:06.180 --> 22:07.740
the most forgiving person alive.

258
22:10.220 --> 22:12.060
You all know who wants to mess with Lingnan's officials.

259
22:12.740 --> 22:13.700
Killing Yan Shang

260
22:13.980 --> 22:15.300
won't let you rest easy.

261
22:16.060 --> 22:17.500
If anything happens to Yan Shang,

262
22:18.260 --> 22:20.220
Xun and I will become sworn enemies.

263
22:20.580 --> 22:22.140
My job is to protect the Crown Prince.

264
22:23.140 --> 22:23.980
Your business with him

265
22:24.420 --> 22:24.900
isn't my concern.

266
22:28.620 --> 22:30.460
Yan Shang, you should know

267
22:30.980 --> 22:32.460
what a storm those findings of yours in Lingnan

268
22:32.660 --> 22:33.580
will cause

269
22:33.660 --> 22:34.660
if they reach His Majesty's ears.

270
22:35.860 --> 22:37.300
You've seen what His Majesty is like.

271
22:38.220 --> 22:40.180
Don't think you and Wanyao will get away unscathed.

272
22:42.340 --> 22:42.860
Cat got your tongue?

273
22:43.380 --> 22:44.100
Gone dumb?

274
22:44.780 --> 22:45.300
Good.

275
22:46.020 --> 22:47.100
That's how you'll make it back

276
22:47.180 --> 22:48.060
to Sheng'an alive.

277
22:48.420 --> 22:49.260
Shut up, Yang Si!

278
22:50.300 --> 22:51.420
He's barely hanging on.

279
22:51.820 --> 22:53.140
It's a miracle if he makes it back alive.

280
22:53.540 --> 22:53.860
I...

281
22:59.460 --> 23:00.260
He's burning up.

282
23:01.100 --> 23:02.900
It probably isn't safe to seek medical help here.

283
23:03.500 --> 23:04.660
How much longer till we're out of Lingnan?

284
23:04.980 --> 23:05.460
Around midnight.

285
23:05.980 --> 23:07.420
We won't find a physician until tomorrow morning.

286
23:08.700 --> 23:09.220
Hang in there.

287
23:16.700 --> 23:20.500
(Hongfu Inn)

288
23:28.660 --> 23:29.620
It's poison spider vine.

289
23:30.660 --> 23:31.380
How did he

290
23:32.420 --> 23:33.660
get poisoned with that?

291
23:35.380 --> 23:36.100
Got accidentally hit

292
23:36.780 --> 23:38.020
by a hunter while gathering herbs.

293
23:39.940 --> 23:40.580
What about this poison?

294
23:41.740 --> 23:42.580
Is his life in danger?

295
23:44.220 --> 23:45.020
Well...

296
23:45.620 --> 23:46.220
Can he be saved?

297
23:47.580 --> 23:48.620
Or tell me who can save him.

298
23:49.620 --> 23:50.580
Yes, he can be saved.

299
23:51.500 --> 23:54.660
Arrows laced with this poison are deadly.

300
23:55.660 --> 23:56.940
But he's lucky.

301
23:57.340 --> 23:58.980
Thanks to your quick treatment,

302
23:59.340 --> 24:00.860
he just needs medication now.

303
24:01.740 --> 24:02.460
He should

304
24:02.980 --> 24:04.220
be out of danger.

305
24:04.660 --> 24:05.860
Please go prepare the prescription.

306
24:06.780 --> 24:07.540
Yes.

307
24:14.700 --> 24:15.340
Wanyao.

308
24:21.100 --> 24:21.740
Wanyao.

309
24:34.980 --> 24:35.700
How are you feeling?

310
24:39.500 --> 24:40.420
Wanyao.

311
25:28.940 --> 25:29.300
Wanyao.

312
25:30.060 --> 25:30.500
Come out here.

313
25:46.220 --> 25:46.820
Is he out of danger?

314
25:49.220 --> 25:49.860
Changed your mind?

315
25:51.980 --> 25:52.860
You'd better talk some sense into him.

316
25:53.540 --> 25:54.620
If he doesn't want to drag you down,

317
25:55.020 --> 25:55.900
he'd better keep his mouth shut forever.

318
25:56.020 --> 25:56.780
I will.

319
25:57.700 --> 25:58.700
But you should know

320
25:59.100 --> 26:00.100
that Yan Shang isn't the only one

321
26:00.540 --> 26:01.500
who knows the Crown Prince's secrets.

322
26:01.940 --> 26:02.540
I know them too.

323
26:03.540 --> 26:05.460
Killing just him won't be enough.

324
26:19.220 --> 26:19.780
Sir.

325
26:25.820 --> 26:26.900
I'm from Lingnan.

326
26:27.940 --> 26:29.380
I've heard of poison spider vine.

327
26:30.740 --> 26:31.420
I know

328
26:32.260 --> 26:33.340
that my surviving

329
26:34.260 --> 26:36.540
proves your exceptional skill.

330
26:37.980 --> 26:38.740
The rest

331
26:40.140 --> 26:41.740
is beyond human power.

332
26:42.700 --> 26:43.740
It'll be up to fate.

333
26:44.700 --> 26:45.220
So

334
26:46.580 --> 26:47.740
please,

335
26:48.540 --> 26:49.540
tell me everything you know.

336
26:51.060 --> 26:52.300
Do you realize that if anything goes wrong,

337
26:52.780 --> 26:54.180
the lives of everyone in the Eastern Palace

338
26:54.420 --> 26:55.820
will be on my shoulders?

339
26:55.820 --> 26:56.300
Yang Si.

340
26:57.660 --> 26:58.500
I want him

341
26:59.100 --> 27:00.420
to keep his mouth shut more than you do.

342
27:30.620 --> 27:33.060
Poison spider vine is the most venomous plant

343
27:33.620 --> 27:34.820
in the mountains of Lingnan.

344
27:35.820 --> 27:37.620
Nine out of ten who are poisoned die.

345
27:38.380 --> 27:39.340
Even those who survive

346
27:39.980 --> 27:41.060
may go blind,

347
27:41.620 --> 27:42.700
deaf,

348
27:43.380 --> 27:44.700
or become paralyzed.

349
27:45.180 --> 27:46.900
They are all left incapacitated.

350
27:51.740 --> 27:53.060
How long can I keep it from her?

351
27:56.420 --> 27:58.140
Ten days at most

352
27:59.020 --> 28:00.340
before the poison takes effect.

353
28:05.380 --> 28:06.060
That'll be enough.

354
28:11.460 --> 28:12.180
Get some more sleep.

355
28:13.340 --> 28:14.180
I'll stay here with you.

356
28:18.260 --> 28:19.580
I want to look at you a while longer.

357
28:28.180 --> 28:32.380
(Blessings in Harmony with Time)

358
28:44.940 --> 28:45.780
How could

359
28:47.460 --> 28:49.020
Her Highness suddenly take her own life?

360
28:53.220 --> 28:53.940
Greetings, Your Highness.

361
29:01.140 --> 29:02.140
His Highness says

362
29:02.420 --> 29:03.700
that now that the Princess Consort has passed,

363
29:03.980 --> 29:06.180
you should raise the child.

364
29:36.180 --> 29:36.660
Wenji?

365
29:38.260 --> 29:38.900
What brings you here?

366
29:39.260 --> 29:40.180
I'm here on imperial order

367
29:41.100 --> 29:42.660
to deliver funeral funds for the Princess Consort of Jin.

368
29:58.380 --> 29:59.100
The child is back now.

369
30:00.100 --> 30:00.540
Chunhua,

370
30:02.180 --> 30:02.700
are you happy?

371
30:14.300 --> 30:14.940
From now on,

372
30:15.900 --> 30:17.100
no one will threaten you anymore.

373
30:19.260 --> 30:19.940
And you won't have to cry...

374
30:37.180 --> 30:37.820
It was you?

375
30:41.620 --> 30:41.940
Yes.

376
30:45.060 --> 30:46.420
I'm finally

377
30:49.220 --> 30:51.100
not useless anymore.

378
31:35.300 --> 31:36.940
I slipped out of the military governor's residence and headed out of the city.

379
31:37.540 --> 31:38.380
I searched everywhere. When I couldn't find you,

380
31:38.700 --> 31:39.900
I figured you'd already gone north.

381
31:40.500 --> 31:41.860
You sure move fast, Your Highness.

382
31:42.100 --> 31:43.220
Good thing you found us.

383
31:44.340 --> 31:44.980
Look who you're dealing with.

384
31:49.060 --> 31:49.580
You're awake.

385
31:56.740 --> 31:57.420
Should we slow down?

386
31:57.900 --> 31:58.660
Is it too bumpy?

387
31:59.180 --> 32:00.700
Fang Tong! Faster!

388
32:06.660 --> 32:07.140
No need.

389
32:08.020 --> 32:08.620
I'm fine.

390
32:12.140 --> 32:12.900
Where are we?

391
32:13.580 --> 32:14.540
Lantian is just ahead.

392
32:14.900 --> 32:15.620
Almost back in Sheng'an.

393
32:18.060 --> 32:18.460
Good.

394
32:30.620 --> 32:33.940
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

395
32:37.260 --> 32:37.620
Easy.

396
32:41.460 --> 32:42.900
Your Highness, someone from the palace is here.

397
32:43.100 --> 32:44.980
They've been waiting here for days.

398
32:49.100 --> 32:50.580
By His Majesty's command.

399
32:51.500 --> 32:51.980
Yan Shang.

400
32:56.100 --> 32:58.260
How did your work in Lingnan go?

401
33:06.740 --> 33:07.220
Mr. Yan?

402
33:08.420 --> 33:09.620
How's the disaster relief?

403
33:09.940 --> 33:11.860
How's the inspection of funds and grain along the Lingnan circuit?

404
33:12.260 --> 33:13.940
What did you see on your trip to Lingnan?

405
33:14.460 --> 33:15.100
Do you have a report?

406
33:16.220 --> 33:16.940
Please tell His Majesty...

407
33:16.940 --> 33:19.140
His Majesty asked Mr. Yan,

408
33:19.340 --> 33:20.780
not you, Your Highness.

409
33:23.580 --> 33:24.340
Your Majesty,

410
33:25.540 --> 33:26.380
I've failed.

411
33:26.980 --> 33:28.140
I've let you down.

412
33:28.580 --> 33:29.340
Relief efforts fell short.

413
33:30.100 --> 33:31.420
And the inspection turned up nothing.

414
33:32.140 --> 33:33.260
I couldn't ease your burden.

415
33:33.780 --> 33:34.300
I deserve

416
33:34.900 --> 33:35.940
death.

417
33:42.460 --> 33:43.060
Mr. Yan.

418
33:43.700 --> 33:44.500
That doesn't add up.

419
33:46.060 --> 33:47.300
What does His Majesty intend to do with him?

420
33:47.740 --> 33:48.500
Princess Danyang,

421
33:50.020 --> 33:51.020
he won't be staying

422
33:51.900 --> 33:52.860
in such a fine residence anymore.

423
33:54.860 --> 33:56.700
His Majesty gave orders.

424
33:57.220 --> 33:59.900
If Mr. Yan returns with nothing to report,

425
34:00.260 --> 34:01.620
he'll go straight to the Imperial Prison.

426
34:05.300 --> 34:05.820
Mr. Yan.

427
34:06.740 --> 34:07.140
Please.

428
34:33.740 --> 34:34.220
It's all right.

429
34:59.860 --> 35:00.940
I saved you once.

430
35:02.580 --> 35:03.660
I can save you again.

431
35:06.060 --> 35:06.580
Yan Shang.

432
35:08.700 --> 35:10.220
There's no obstacle I can't overcome.

433
35:14.700 --> 35:15.980
Yu Niang served me faithfully

434
35:16.980 --> 35:17.860
for years.

435
35:18.660 --> 35:19.900
Now the Eastern Palace

436
35:20.220 --> 35:21.300
is in greater danger than ever.

437
35:22.340 --> 35:23.540
And yet she fell in Lingnan.

438
35:28.260 --> 35:28.980
Yan Shang

439
35:30.060 --> 35:31.300
knows when to fold.

440
35:31.900 --> 35:32.860
He said nothing

441
35:33.620 --> 35:34.500
and went to prison.

442
35:38.300 --> 35:39.940
Do you still think I should have him silenced?

443
35:41.580 --> 35:42.660
He's been unconscious for days.

444
35:43.140 --> 35:44.100
I went through everything carefully.

445
35:44.780 --> 35:46.340
He brought nothing back from Lingnan.

446
35:47.060 --> 35:48.140
He barely escaped with his life.

447
35:48.580 --> 35:49.340
Words prove nothing.

448
35:50.860 --> 35:52.020
I'm not blaming you.

449
35:52.260 --> 35:54.060
But I've never seen you look this bad.

450
35:55.780 --> 35:56.540
Have you thought about it?

451
35:57.460 --> 35:58.660
Even if he keeps his mouth shut,

452
35:59.540 --> 35:59.980
His Majesty

453
36:00.500 --> 36:01.620
has probably figured out most of it.

454
36:02.020 --> 36:02.820
I thought the same.

455
36:03.340 --> 36:03.860
This matter

456
36:04.780 --> 36:05.980
is known not just to Yan Shang

457
36:06.420 --> 36:07.100
and Wanyao.

458
36:07.420 --> 36:07.980
His Majesty

459
36:08.580 --> 36:10.220
surely has some inkling too.

460
36:11.180 --> 36:12.220
But without proof,

461
36:12.980 --> 36:13.620
what can he do?

462
36:14.940 --> 36:16.500
You're the Crown Prince of Huai, after all.

463
36:19.820 --> 36:20.820
What is a Crown Prince?

464
36:22.500 --> 36:24.300
Just an heir who holds His Majesty's favor.

465
36:25.020 --> 36:25.580
It could be me,

466
36:27.340 --> 36:28.660
and it could be anyone at any moment.

467
36:29.660 --> 36:30.820
If His Majesty's favor ever shifts,

468
36:31.380 --> 36:32.220
the heir's seat

469
36:33.220 --> 36:34.100
and the Eastern Palace

470
36:35.100 --> 36:36.420
could be overturned in an instant.

471
36:40.500 --> 36:41.580
While you were in Lingnan,

472
36:42.580 --> 36:44.100
I spent every waking moment

473
36:44.660 --> 36:45.860
thinking about the same thing.

474
36:46.540 --> 36:48.020
Ever since His Majesty confined us

475
36:48.660 --> 36:49.580
and sent Yan Shang south,

476
36:50.580 --> 36:51.260
he'd already made up

477
36:51.740 --> 36:52.660
his mind.

478
36:53.220 --> 36:54.700
We should never have held onto hope.

479
36:56.020 --> 36:56.980
Rather than live in fear,

480
36:57.260 --> 36:57.860
waiting

481
36:58.140 --> 36:59.140
and guessing,

482
37:01.660 --> 37:02.300
we might as well...

483
38:17.940 --> 38:18.380
Shang.

484
38:19.060 --> 38:20.500
You can start scattering the seeds.

485
38:20.500 --> 38:20.820
Okay.

486
38:26.260 --> 38:27.380
I found lots of wild greens!

487
38:27.620 --> 38:28.660
We'll have something to eat tonight.

488
38:29.020 --> 38:29.660
Xiaozhou, you're here.

489
38:32.340 --> 38:32.700
What is it?

490
38:36.340 --> 38:37.060
What's so funny?

491
38:38.500 --> 38:39.020
Shang,

492
38:39.340 --> 38:40.940
you two just aren't cut out for farming.

493
38:41.740 --> 38:43.380
The furrows are all crooked.

494
38:43.500 --> 38:44.980
And the seeds are scattered way too thin.

495
38:46.660 --> 38:47.420
Let me do it.

496
38:47.540 --> 38:47.860
Don't bother.

497
38:48.500 --> 38:49.220
Just show us how.

498
38:56.140 --> 38:56.660
Forget it.

499
38:57.860 --> 38:58.780
Let's just plant what we can.

500
38:59.580 --> 39:01.380
Anyway, we might not even get a harvest.

501
39:07.740 --> 39:09.020
We're living deep in the mountains.

502
39:09.780 --> 39:10.740
If we quietly clear a little land,

503
39:11.180 --> 39:12.140
the authorities won't find out.

504
39:15.100 --> 39:16.060
Don't believe me? Just try it.

505
39:16.740 --> 39:18.460
Even if you live deeper in the mountains,

506
39:19.060 --> 39:20.500
they'll still find you when they want to

507
39:20.740 --> 39:21.660
collect taxes and conscript labor.

508
39:24.220 --> 39:24.820
But

509
39:25.860 --> 39:26.620
that's not how it should be.

510
39:37.780 --> 39:38.780
With land this good

511
39:39.540 --> 39:40.500
and rain this plentiful,

512
39:42.020 --> 39:43.140
all that hard work

513
39:45.300 --> 39:46.620
should be enough to keep people fed.

514
40:27.460 --> 40:29.940
Du Ping, Transport Commissioner of Lingnan.

515
40:32.820 --> 40:33.540
Pei Xuanming,

516
40:34.860 --> 40:37.300
Director of the Bureau of Operations in the Ministry of War.

517
40:38.340 --> 40:40.020
Wang Heling, Vice Minister of Revenue.

518
40:41.380 --> 40:42.180
Wang Heling...

519
40:44.500 --> 40:46.660
Cheng An, Chamberlain of the Eastern Palace.

520
40:48.860 --> 40:50.580
Cheng An, Chamberlain of the Eastern Palace.

521
40:52.100 --> 40:53.340
- Director of the Bureau of Opera... - Yan Shang.

522
40:54.020 --> 40:54.380
Yan Shang?

523
40:59.580 --> 40:59.940
Yan Shang.

524
41:01.620 --> 41:02.020
Yan Shang!

525
41:07.780 --> 41:08.460
Wenji?

526
41:13.860 --> 41:14.580
I'm sorry.

527
41:16.060 --> 41:17.940
The things you asked me to deliver to your father...

528
41:18.780 --> 41:19.260
I...

529
41:20.900 --> 41:22.180
No need to explain that now.

530
41:26.540 --> 41:26.860
Shang,

531
41:27.820 --> 41:28.900
I don't have much time in here.

532
41:29.940 --> 41:31.500
How should I plead for you before His Majesty?

533
41:33.260 --> 41:33.780
Tell me.

534
41:38.540 --> 41:39.060
Wenji.

535
41:40.180 --> 41:41.780
Could you get me paper and brush?

536
41:58.580 --> 42:03.420
(Yingxiang, twenty entries, Huai collection.)

537
42:15.500 --> 42:18.620
(Eight hundred guan spent on Fei's techniques and armor supplies.)

538
42:30.980 --> 42:33.060
(Three hundred guan remaining. Check the accounts from previous years.)

539
42:39.340 --> 42:42.900
(Actual labor and material cost eight hundred guan.)

540
42:56.740 --> 42:58.420
(Fifty dan of grain in storage. Cao reports that the rat problem has eased.)

541
44:03.340 --> 44:03.860
Wanyao?

542
44:12.660 --> 44:13.380
Greetings, Father.

543
44:14.460 --> 44:15.060
What is it?

544
44:15.780 --> 44:17.660
I'd like to ask you for a favor.

545
44:20.740 --> 44:22.140
You're a smart girl.

546
44:23.140 --> 44:24.340
You know it's impossible.

547
44:25.140 --> 44:26.300
Why even ask?

548
44:27.260 --> 44:28.860
I wouldn't ask for something impossible.

549
44:29.740 --> 44:31.020
I'd never put you on the spot, Father.

550
44:32.740 --> 44:33.420
Let's hear it.

551
44:34.660 --> 44:35.460
Yan Shang

552
44:36.100 --> 44:36.860
is useless,

553
44:37.500 --> 44:38.300
mediocre,

554
44:38.780 --> 44:39.580
and unfit for service.

555
44:40.220 --> 44:42.140
I ask you to banish him from Sheng'an.

556
44:46.420 --> 44:47.140
You're willing to let him go?

557
44:47.700 --> 44:48.740
Even the most favored male favorite

558
44:49.860 --> 44:51.220
eventually loses his appeal.

559
44:51.980 --> 44:52.540
Besides,

560
44:53.060 --> 44:55.260
he's caused me more than enough trouble.

561
44:58.380 --> 44:59.420
Can you really let him go?

562
44:59.740 --> 45:00.340
Yes.

563
45:01.820 --> 45:02.860
Father, please send him away.

564
45:03.420 --> 45:04.460
Keep him out of the palace forever.

565
45:05.300 --> 45:05.860
And forbid him

566
45:06.340 --> 45:07.980
from ever setting foot in Sheng'an again.

567
45:18.300 --> 45:22.980
(Next Episode Preview)

568
45:23.060 --> 45:23.540
Stop!

569
45:24.220 --> 45:24.700
Move!

570
45:26.380 --> 45:26.860
Yan Shang.

571
45:27.860 --> 45:28.940
What did I tell you?

572
45:29.300 --> 45:30.420
Why did you lie to me?

573
45:30.940 --> 45:33.140
I've always despised betrayal above all else.

574
45:39.640 --> 45:42.933
♪Be the ferry where you wait for the sun♪

575
45:45.618 --> 45:50.534
♪Be the blue silk that catches your tears♪

576
45:52.728 --> 45:58.573
♪Be the sleeve we held, worn by dust and years♪

577
45:59.073 --> 46:04.299
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

578
46:07.068 --> 46:11.859
♪Let me be a captive beast bound by the same lock as you♪

579
46:12.695 --> 46:18.774
♪- Through trails of mud and blood; - let grief drown in your eyes♪

580
46:20.575 --> 46:23.725
♪Soar with the wind; plunge into hellfire as one♪

581
46:23.725 --> 46:25.373
♪Burning bright as a song♪

582
46:25.425 --> 46:29.149
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

583
46:29.527 --> 46:34.193
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

584
46:34.812 --> 46:38.853
♪If we say forever, then forever it shall be♪

585
46:39.344 --> 46:41.459
♪Not a single hour less♪

586
46:41.499 --> 46:48.445
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

587
46:49.208 --> 46:52.661
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

588
46:52.841 --> 46:55.986
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

589
46:56.425 --> 47:03.062
♪If we can stay, let's return to the village of our first meeting♪

590
47:03.459 --> 47:05.497
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

591
47:05.497 --> 47:07.973
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

592
47:08.011 --> 47:10.480
♪You're the only one I need♪

593
47:10.684 --> 47:17.571
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

594
47:17.883 --> 47:21.154
♪Be mine in this world; be mine in this life♪

595
47:21.459 --> 47:24.632
♪My last untouched innocence♪

596
47:24.956 --> 47:28.382
♪If only we could return to the village where we first met♪

597
47:28.615 --> 47:31.840
♪Stay by me; help me forget the frozen dream of last night♪

598
47:32.171 --> 47:38.967
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips; just us, through dawn and dusk♪

599
47:39.336 --> 47:41.398
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

600
47:41.399 --> 47:43.902
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

601
47:43.949 --> 47:46.287
♪You're the only one I need♪

602
47:46.518 --> 47:53.353
♪By your side, through joy and pain, is that eternity?♪

603
47:53.702 --> 47:55.320
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

604
47:55.450 --> 47:57.246
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

605
47:57.603 --> 48:00.620
♪You're the only one I need♪

606
48:00.660 --> 48:01.987
(No animals were harmed or mistreated in production.)
